- * SM8475 (diwali) tables, ported from the downstream init sequence.
- * Same QSERDES V5 / QPHY V4 PCS register layout as SM8350.
+ * SM8475 (diwali) uses the 4 nm QSERDES COM (V6) register layout.
+ * Keep the complete Liuqin downstream sequence, including both VCO tune
+ * bytes and the core-clock/common configuration, before starting the PHY.
+ * Its USB TX/RX and PCS offsets below retain the V5/V4 layout.
  */
